        "Description": "Good Morning, 47. We have found a new target located in Morocco, Marrakesh. The target is Zaki Diar, a fortune teller which has been seen robbing from shops multiple times this year. Browsing through files we also found out that the target has been seen murdering someone on Marrakeshi streets. The target could be a problem to city, but you are the solution. We need you 47 to clear him out of the way. Good luck eliminating this piece of fortune!",
